      "source_quote": "通理弟乂理字季英，會理第六弟也。",
      "reading": "通理弟乂理字季英，本傳稱會理第六弟。",
      "note": "通理弟乂理字季英，本傳稱會理第六弟。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 16,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence1-16",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "生十旬而簡王薨，至三歲而能言，見內人分散，涕泣相送，乂理問其故，或曰：「此簡王宮人，喪畢去爾。」",
      "reading": "出生十旬簡王薨。三歲見宮人散歸而詢問，旁人言宮人因喪畢離去。",
      "note": "出生十旬簡王薨。三歲見宮人散歸而詢問，旁人言宮人因喪畢離去。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 16,
      "end_codepoint": 64,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence1-64",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "乂理便號泣，悲不自勝，諸宮人見之，莫不傷感，爲之停者三人焉。",
      "reading": "乂理號泣，三人感其哀而留。",
      "note": "乂理號泣，三人感其哀而留。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 64,
      "end_codepoint": 94,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence1-94",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "服闋後，見高祖，又悲泣不自勝。",
      "reading": "服闋再見高祖，仍不勝哀。",
      "note": "服闋再見高祖，仍不勝哀。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 94,
      "end_codepoint": 109,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence1-109",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "高祖爲之流涕，謂左右曰：「此兒大必爲奇士。」",
      "reading": "高祖流涕，謂此兒將為奇士。",
      "note": "高祖流涕，謂此兒將為奇士。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 109,
      "end_codepoint": 131,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence1-131",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "大同八年，封安樂縣侯，邑五百戶。",
      "reading": "大同八年（542）封安樂縣侯，邑五百戶。殿本作建安縣侯。",
      "note": "大同八年（542）封安樂縣侯，邑五百戶。殿本作建安縣侯。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 131,
      "end_codepoint": 147,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "乂理性慷慨，慕立功名，每讀書見忠臣烈士，未嘗不廢卷歎曰：「一生之內，當無愧古人。」",
      "reading": "讀忠臣烈士的事蹟有志效之。",
      "note": "讀忠臣烈士的事蹟有志效之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 41,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence2-41",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "博覽多識，有文才，嘗祭孔文舉墓，幷爲立碑，制文甚美。",
      "reading": "博覽有文才，祭孔融墓，撰文立碑。",
      "note": "博覽有文才，祭孔融墓，撰文立碑。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 41,
      "end_codepoint": 67,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "太清中，侯景內寇，乂理聚賓客數百，輕裝赴南兗州，隨兄會理入援，恒親當矢石，爲士卒先。",
      "reading": "侯景之亂，乂理聚賓客赴南兗州，隨兄入援。",
      "note": "侯景之亂，乂理聚賓客赴南兗州，隨兄入援。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 42,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence3-42",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "及城陷，又隨會理還廣陵，因入齊爲質，乞師。",
      "reading": "城陷還廣陵，向北齊質子求援。",
      "note": "城陷還廣陵，向北齊質子求援。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 42,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence3-63",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "行二日，會侯景遣董紹先據廣陵，遂追會理，因爲所獲。",
      "reading": "董紹先奉侯景命據廣陵，段落中「遂追會理」沿用原文，南史作遂追獲之。",
      "note": "董紹先奉侯景命據廣陵，段落中「遂追會理」沿用原文，南史作遂追獲之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 88,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence3-88",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "紹先防之甚嚴，不得與兄弟相見，乃偽請先還京，得入辭母，謂其姊安固公主曰：「事旣如此，豈可闔家受斃。",
      "reading": "隔絕兄弟，乂理偽請入京辭母，對姊安固公主說家人同臨危局。殿本作固安。",
      "note": "隔絕兄弟，乂理偽請入京辭母，對姊安固公主說家人同臨危局。殿本作固安。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 88,
      "end_codepoint": 137,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence3-137",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "兄若至，願爲言之，善爲計自勉，勿賜以爲念也。",
      "reading": "原文「勿賜以爲念」，南史及殿本作顧。",
      "note": "原文「勿賜以爲念」，南史及殿本作顧。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 137,
      "end_codepoint": 159,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence3-159",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "家國阽危，雖死非恨，前途亦思立效，但未知天命何如耳！」",
      "reading": "仍是乂理對姊告別。",
      "note": "仍是乂理對姊告別。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 159,
      "end_codepoint": 186,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence3-186",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "至京師，以魏降人元貞立節忠正，可以託孤，乃以玉柄扇贈之。",
      "reading": "赴京後想託孤於降人元貞，贈玉柄扇。",
      "note": "赴京後想託孤於降人元貞，贈玉柄扇。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 186,
      "end_codepoint": 214,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence3-214",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "貞怪其故，不受。",
      "reading": "元貞推辭。",
      "note": "元貞推辭。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 214,
      "end_codepoint": 222,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence3-222",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "乂理曰：「後當見憶，幸勿推辭。」",
      "reading": "乂理勸受，留下日後想起之語。",
      "note": "乂理勸受，留下日後想起之語。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 222,
      "end_codepoint": 238,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence3-238",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "會祖皓起兵，乂理奔長蘆，收軍得千餘人。",
      "reading": "祖皓起事，乂理奔長蘆，得兵千餘。",
      "note": "祖皓起事，乂理奔長蘆，得兵千餘。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 238,
      "end_codepoint": 257,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:received_sentence3-257",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CC",
      "source_quote": "其左右有應賊者，因間劫會理，其衆遂駭散，爲景所害，時年二十一。",
      "reading": "其左右響應侯景，眾潰，乂理被害，本傳報二十一。南史明接乂理為所害者。",
      "note": "其左右響應侯景，眾潰，乂理被害，本傳報二十一。南史明接乂理為所害者。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 257,
      "end_codepoint": 288,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
